        {
          "text": "48",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Farriin Ku Saabsan Moo'aab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbiga ciidammada oo ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil wuxuu reer Moo'aab ka leeyahay, Waxaa iska hoogtay Neboo! Waayo, iyadu way baabba'day. Qiryaatayim waa la ceebeeyey oo waa la qabsaday, Misgaabna waa la ceebeeyey, waana la dumiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dalka Moo'aab ammaan dambe ma leh. Xeshboon baa shar loogu hindisay, oo waxaa la yidhaahdaa, Kaalaya oo aynu baabbi'innee si ayan quruun u sii ahaan. Madmeenay, adigana waa lagu baabbi'in doonaa, oo seef baa ku eryan doonta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa Xoronayim laga maqli doonaa oohin qayladeed, kharribaad iyo baabba' weyn aawadood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dalka Moo'aab waa la wada baabbi'iyey, oo dhallaankiisiina qaylo bay maqashiiyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, jiirtii Luxiid waxaa lala fuuli doonaa oohin aan kala joogsanayn, waayo, dhaadhaca Xoronayim waxay ka maqleen tiiraanyadii oohinta baabbi'idda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Carara, oo naftiinna badbaadiya, oo waxaad noqotaan sida geed xun oo cidlada ku yaal oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, waxaad isku hallaysay shuqulladaada iyo khasnadahaaga, oo sidaas daraaddeed adigana waa lagu qabsan doonaa, oo Kemooshna maxaabiis ahaan buu u bixi doonaa, isaga iyo wadaaddadiisa, iyo amiirradiisaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo baabbi'iyuhuna wuxuu ku soo duuli doonaa magaalo kasta, oo magaalona kama baxsan doonto. Oo weliba sidii Rabbigu yidhi, Dooxaduna way halligmi doontaa, oo bannaankuna wuu baabbi'i doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dalka Moo'aab baalal siiya si uu u duulo oo uu u cararo. Magaalooyinkiisu waxay noqon doonaan cidla aan ciduna dhex degganayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkaaru ha ku dhacdo kii shuqulka Rabbiga si dayac ah u sameeya, oo inkaaru ha ku dhacdo kii seeftiisa dib uga celiya inay dhiig daadiso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dalka Moo'aab wuu iska istareexsanaa tan iyo yaraantiisii, oo sida khamri deggan ayuu iskaga dul fadhiyey gufarkiisii, oo weelna weel kale lagagama shubin, oo maxaabbiisahaanna marna looma kaxaysan, sidaas daraaddeed dhadhankiisii wuu ku sii hadhay isaga, oo udgoonkiisiina innaba ma beddelmin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal eega, waxaa iman doona wakhti aan isaga u soo diri doono kuwa wax shuba, isagayna shubayaan, oo weelashiisay madhinayaan, oo jalxadihiisana wada burburinayaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidii reer binu Israa'iil ay Beytel oo ay ku kalsoonaayeen ugu ceeboobeen, sidaas oo kale ayaa reer Moo'aabna Kemoosh ugu ceeboobi doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idinku sidee baad u odhan kartaan, Annagu waxaannu nahay dagaalyahan iyo rag u xoog badan dagaalka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boqorka magiciisu yahay Rabbiga ciidammadu wuxuu leeyahay, Dalka Moo'aab cidla buu noqday, oo magaalooyinkiisiina way baabbe'een, oo kuwa barbaarradiisii u wanaagsanaana waxay hoos ugu dhaadheceen in la gowraco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moo'aab masiibadiisii mar dhow bay imanaysaa, oo dhibtiisiina aad iyo aad bay u soo degdegaysaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwiinna hareerihiisa ku wareegsan oo magiciisa yaqaan oo dhammow, u baroorta, oo waxaad tidhaahdaan, Ushii xoogga iyo quruxda badnayd sidee bay u kala jabtay! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dadka Diiboon degganow, sharaftaada hoos uga soo deg oo oon la fadhiiso, waayo, waxaa kugu soo duulay baabbi'iyaha Moo'aab, oo isagu wuxuu dumiyey qalcadahaaga adadag. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwiinna Carooceer degganow, bal jidka dhiniciisa istaaga, oo bal wax fiiriya, oo kan sii cararaya iyo tan sii baxsanaysa waxaad weyddiisaan waxa dhacay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moo'aab waa la ceebeeyey, waayo, wuu baabba'ay. Haddaba ooya oo qayliya, oo Arnoon ka sheega in Moo'aab baabba'ay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xukun baa ku dhacay dalka bannaanka ah, iyo Xolon, iyo Yahsaah, iyo Mefacad, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Diiboon, iyo Neboo, iyo Beytdiblaatayim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Qiryaatayim, iyo Beytgaamuul, iyo Beytmecoon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Qiryood, iyo Bosraah, iyo magaalooyinka dalka Moo'aab oo dhan, kuwa dhow iyo kuwa fogba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Dalka Moo'aab geeskiisii waa la gooyay oo gacantiisiina waa jabtay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaga sakhraamiya, waayo, Rabbiguu iska sii weyneeyey, oo Moo'aab wuxuu ku dhex galgalan doonaa mantaggiisa, oo weliba wuxuu noqon doonaa wax lagu qoslo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, miyaan dalka Israa'iil wax lagu qoslo kuu ahayn? Miyaase isaga laga helay tuugag dhexdood? Waayo, markaad isaga ka hadashidba madaxaad ruxruxdaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwa dalka Moo'aab degganow, magaalooyinka ka taga, oo dhagaxa weyn ku hoyda, oo waxaad la mid noqotaan sidii qoolleyda buulkeeda ka samaysata dhinacyada bohol afkeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaannu maqalnay kibirkii Moo'aab oo uu aad u kibray, iyo xataa kor-isu-qaadiddiisa, iyo kibirkiisa, iyo madaxweynaantiisa, iyo qabweynaanta qalbigiisaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Anigu waan ogahay inaan cadhadiisu waxba ahayn oo faankiisuna innaba waxba tarayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Moo'aab waan u barooran doonaa, oo waxaan u qaylin doonaa reer Moo'aab oo dhan daraaddood, waana loo barooran doonaa dadka Qiir Xeres. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Canabka Sibmaahow, waxaan kuugu ooyi doonaa oohin ka sii daran tii Yacser. Laamahaagii badday dhaafeen, oo waxay gaadheen xataa tan iyo badda Yacser. Baabbi'iyihii wuxuu soo dhacay midhahaagii la hor guray iyo canabkaagii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farxadda iyo rayraynta waa laga qaaday beertii midhaha badnayd iyo dalka Moo'aabba, oo waxaan ka dhigay in khamri macsarooyinka laga waayo, oo ciduna kuma tuman doonto iyagoo heesaya, oo heestooduna innaba hees ma noqon doonto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qayladii Xeshboon waxay gaadhay Elecaaleeh iyo tan iyo Yahas, oo waxaa laga dhawaaqay Socar iyo ilaa Xoronayim iyo ilaa Ceglad Shelishiyaah, waayo, xataa biyihii Nimriim way baabba'ayaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Waxaan Moo'aab ka joojin doonaa kan meesha sare allabariga ku bixiya, iyo kan ilaahyadiisa fooxa u shidaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidaas daraaddeed dalka Moo'aab aawadiis qalbigaygu waa u dhawaaqaa sida biibiile oo kale, oo dadka Qiir Xeres aawadoodna qalbigaygu sida biibiile oo kale waa u dhawaaqaa, saas aawadeed maalkii badnaa ee ay heleen waa ka wada baabba'ay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, madax kastaba waa la xiiray, oo gadh kastaba waa la jaray, oo gacmaha oo dhanna nabaraa ku kor yaal, oo dhexdana joonyad baa ku xidhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Guryaha Moo'aab dushooda, iyo jidadkiisa dhexdooda waxaa meel kasta jira baroorasho, waayo, Moo'aab waxaan u burburiyey sidii weel aan la doonaynin oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidee buu u dumay! Sidee baa reer Moo'aab dhabarka ceeb ula sii jeediyey! Markaasuu reer Moo'aab kuwa hareerihiisa ku wareegsan oo dhan u noqon doonaa wax lagu qoslo oo lagu naxo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal eega, wuxuu u soo duuli doonaa sida gorgor oo kale, oo baalashiisana wuxuu ku fidin doonaa dalka Moo'aab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qiryood waa la qabsaday, oo qalcadihiina waa la argaggixiyey, oo ragga xoogga badan ee Moo'aab qalbigoodu wuxuu maalintaas noqon doonaa sida naag fooli hayso qalbigeed oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Moo'aab waa la baabbi'in doonaa si uusan innaba quruun u sii ahaan, maxaa yeelay, Rabbiguu iska sii weyneeyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Kan Moo'aab degganow, waxaa ku hor yaal cabsi, iyo yaamays, iyo dabin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kii cabsida ka cararaa wuxuu ku dhici doonaa yaamayska, oo kii yaamayska ka soo baxana waxaa qaban doona dabinka, waayo, Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Waxaan reer Moo'aab ku soo dul dejin doonaa sannaddii ciqaabiddooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwii cararay waxay istaagan yihiin hooska Xeshboon, iyagoo taag gabay, waayo, dab baa Xeshboon ka soo baxay, ololna wuxuu ka soo baxay Siixon dhexdeeda, oo wuxuu baabbi'iyey Moo'aab darafkeeda iyo kuwa bulxanka badan dhaladooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moo'aabow, adigaa iska hoogay, Kemoosh dadkiisii way wada halligmeen, maxaa yeelay, wiilashaadii maxaabiis ahaan baa loo kaxaystay, oo gabdhahaagiina waa la wada kaxaystay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiin Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Ugudambaysta maxaabiista reer Moo'aab waan soo celin doonaa. Intaasu waa xukunkii reer Moo'aab.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
